
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dark Elegance | Jessia☆</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #211b23;
      color: #eee5d8;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 28px 22px;
    }

    .page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      padding: 38px 12px;
    }

    .top {
      color: #c7ad79;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .star {
      color: #d6bb7e;
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(35px, 9vw, 47px);
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .line {
      width: 48px;
      height: 1px;
      background: #92784f;
      margin: 26px auto;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #b9a9bd;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .enter {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 36px;
      padding: 12px 23px;
      border: 1px solid #92784f;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: #d8bd83;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
    }

    .enter:hover {
      background: #d8bd83;
      color: #211b23;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 55px;
      color: #8f7c91;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .bottom {
      margin-top: 13px;
      color: #756875;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 360px) {
      .page {
        padding-left: 2px;
        padding-right: 2px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="top">A BIRTHDAY PROJECT · 30</div>

    <div class="star">✦</div>

    <h1>My Life,<br>My Life</h1>

    <div class="line"></div>

    <p class="subtitle">
      A little world, made with love.<br>
      For Jungkook, from Jessia☆
    </p>

    <a class="enter" href="#welcome">
      ENTER THIS LITTLE WORLD ♡
    </a>

    <div class="signature">— Jessia☆</div>

    <div class="bottom">
      MADE WITH LOVE · 2026
    </div>
  </main>

  <section id="welcome" style="
    min-height: 45vh;
    padding: 60px 25px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #eee5d8;
    background: #30252f;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
  ">
    <h2 style="font-weight: normal; color: #d8bd83;">
      Welcome ♡
    </h2>
    <p style="color: #c5b6c7; line-height: 1.9;">
      Every little detail has a story.<br>
      This is where our journey begins.
    </p>
    <a href="#" style="color: #d8bd83; font-size: 13px;">
      Back to the beginning ↑
    </a>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
